        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "one year ago",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$74\\,488$ people",
          "worked": "The annual growth multiplier is $1+0.074=1.074$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}80\\,000&=P(1.074)\\\\P&=80\\,000\\div1.074\\\\P&\\approx74\\,488\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe population was approximately $74\\,488$ people.",
